<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n97301" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στρόφ-ιγξ</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ιγγος</span><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, ὁ </span>(ἡ, <i><span class="en">
			<u>EM</u>
			446.31
		</span></i>): (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στρέφω</span>):—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>pivot, axle</i> or <i>pin on
				which a body turns</i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				1126
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> pl.,
				<i>pivots working in sockets</i>, at top and bottom of a door,
				<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				5.5.4
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				<u>PCair.Zen.</u>
				782
			</span></i>(<i>a</i>).<i><span class="en">
				7
			</span></i><span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Rom.</u>
				23
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				<u>UP</u>
				1.15
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> metaph.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γλώττης ς</span>., of a
			<i>well-hung</i> tongue, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ra.</u>
				892
			</span></i>; of the vertebrae, <i><span class="en">
				Pherecr.
				236
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ti.</u>
				74a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				74b
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νύμφη ἡ ἐν τῷ ς</span>., dub. sens. in <i><span class="en">
				<u>AJA</u>
				30.249
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Cyprus</span>).</div>
